    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## RM \u00b7 1 \u2014 the weekly run\n\n**Starts:** Monday 08:00, or *Run on demand*.\n\n1. **Flush held cards** \u2014 anything kept back from a non-decision day\n2. **Weekly report** \u2014 last week's views, what published, what it cost\n3. **Gateway: run weekly plan** \u2014 runs the Marketing Manager and its agents on the host (~20 min).\n   n8n is in Docker and cannot reach the host, so every call goes through the gateway on :8787\n4. **Draft valid?** \u2014 an invalid draft messages me *instead of* sending a stack of bad cards\n5. **Approval cards** \u2014 one per item, each carrying its proposed slot\n6. **Run log** \u2014 a row in a Google Sheet, so something outside this Mac knows Monday happened\n\n**Nothing here publishes.** The cards do, and only after a tap recorded in `logs/decisions.jsonl`.\n\n**On failure:** RM \u00b7 0 alerts. Gateway calls retry 3\u00d7 / 5s, so a restart is invisible.",
        "height": 390,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "overview-note",
      "name": "What this workflow does",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
